1.1 Which version is installed
==============================

‘M-x bookmark-gt-version’ shows the installed version followed by the
Emacs version, which is the line to include in a bug report.  With a
prefix argument it inserts that text at point instead.  From Lisp it
returns the version string, which is also the value of the variable
‘bookmark-gt-version’.


