3.1 The ‘*Bookmarks-gt List*’ buffer
====================================

‘M-x bookmark-gt-list’ opens the list buffer.  It is a
‘tabulated-list-mode’ buffer, so you can sort by clicking a column
header or with ‘S’ on a column; ‘s’ cycles the sort through all the
columns, including the marker columns.

* Menu:

* Columns::
