Variable                                  Default                                                              Description
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
‘bookmark-gt-list-name-width’             ‘32’                                                                 Width of the list buffer's Name column; longer names are truncated.
‘bookmark-gt-list-type-width’             ‘12’                                                                 Width of the Type column.
‘bookmark-gt-list-tags-width’             ‘24’                                                                 Width of the Tags column.
